  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoring the Riverine Eco-Systems for Climate Adaptation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this programme, partners propose to restore functionality to a large irrigation scheme in the Middle Shabelle region of Hirshabelle State known as the Jowhar Off Stream Programme (JOSP), with a view to substantially reduce flood risk, mitigate drought, support local production, and boost food security for an entire swathe of the country, enhancing climate resilience for approximately 1.65 million people. The Community Stabilization Unit aims to leverage these positive gains in food and water security to foster developments in peace and stability between conflicting groups in the area.</narrative>
  </description>
